# Build-context exclusions for the site image.
#
# Keep the context small and, more importantly, keep authoring-only material out
# of the image. Note what is deliberately NOT excluded: data/mde/ (the DEM
# rasters the terrain viewer needs) and data/all.json.

# --- never in the context -------------------------------------------------- #
.git
.github
node_modules
dist
.npm-cache
venv
__pycache__
*.pyc

# The real MapTiler key lives in .env. Excluding it forces the build to take the
# key from --build-arg, which keeps the build reproducible and keeps the key out
# of the build context. (.env.example is a documented blank template.)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- authoring only -------------------------------------------------------- #
docs
tools
experiments
tests
*.md
!README.md

# Raw GIS inputs (~7 MB) that feed the Python pipeline. docs/deploy-and-serve-
# dems.md and scripts/copy-static.mjs both treat these as never-published.
data/source
